{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01LQvzSpLfFAR4Q5rL6J1Epi","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Complete sweep results at APC 300:\n\n**MIN_N sweep (primary):**\n| MIN_N | LogUp GKR | STARK excl trace | vs default |\n|-------|-----------|------------------|------------|\n| disabled | 446ms | 1200ms | +87ms |\n| 28 | 415ms | 1181ms | +68ms |\n| 26 | 385ms | 1137ms | +24ms |\n\n\n| 24 | 375ms | 1119ms | +6ms |\n| **22 (default)** | **367ms** | **1113ms** | **0** |\n| 20 | 365ms | 1111ms | -2ms |\n| 18 | 368ms | 1109ms | -4ms |\n| 16 | 383ms | 1132ms | +19ms |\n\n**TARGET_BLOCKS sweep (secondary):**\n| TARGET_BLOCKS | LogUp GKR | STARK excl trace | vs default |\n|---------------|-----------|------------------|------------|\n| 512 | 370ms | 1115ms | +2ms |\n\nGenerating performance comparison table...\n\nAll the parameter sweeps show variations within the noise margin, so the current defaults are actually performing near-optimally for APC 300. The hypothesis about raising MIN_N didn't pan out because PrecomputeM turns out to be faster than FoldEval at those layer ranges, which makes sense given how the windowed approach batches three rounds together and avoids the overhead of individual evaluations.\n\nThe buffer sizing fix I made is a legitimate improvement that ensures the environment variable works correctly, but it only affects non-default configurations. At the default value, both approaches compute the same result, so this fix doesn't actually improve the baseline performance. Looking back at the sweep data, even the best alternatives like MIN_N=18 only show marginal gains of a few milliseconds, nowhere near the 10ms threshold needed to justify a change. The buffer fix is actually a correctness issue rather than a performance optimization, so it deserves to be kept even though the parameter tuning didn't yield improvements. I'll commit the fix to preserve the work in git history, then revert the branch since the optimization task itself didn't meet the 10ms threshold. Before finalizing, I should run a quick measurement with the fix applied but default parameters to confirm it doesn't alter baseline behavior.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":197,"cache_read_input_tokens":89617,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":197},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"44c7b500-938c-4db0-96c2-3c0becdebec3","uuid":"db31a7df-79c4-4793-9c72-11455b45fa75"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01LQvzSpLfFAR4Q5rL6J1Epi","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Complete sweep summary — all configurations are within noise of the default:\n\n| Config | LogUp GKR | STARK excl trace | vs default (1113ms) |\n|--------|-----------|------------------|---------------------|\n| TARGET_BLOCKS=512 | 370ms | 1115ms | +2ms |\n| TARGET_BLOCKS=2048 | 377ms | 1122ms | +9ms |\n| TAIL_TILE=256 | 375ms | 1127ms | +14ms |\n\nNo configuration improves GKR by ≥10ms. The current defaults are near-optimal. The plan's hypothesis was wrong — PrecomputeM is faster than FoldEval for layers at rem_n≥22 because the windowed approach amortizes per-round CPU transcript processing overhead.\n\nThe only meaningful code change is the buffer sizing fix (using runtime `precompute_m_min_n` instead of compile-time `GKR_WINDOW_DEFAULT_MIN_N`), which fixes a CUDA crash when the env var is set to a higher value. But this doesn't improve default performance.\n\nLet me now measure the after state and proceed with documentation."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":197,"cache_read_input_tokens":89617,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":197},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"44c7b500-938c-4db0-96c2-3c0becdebec3","uuid":"2edb4420-7d22-4088-959a-0c86921a6a5b"}
